      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sounds suspiciously close to the chair funny - that one has a bit more requirements (SDK3 world, index controllers, avatar stations) but also is triggered with a radial puppet for all players with index controllers and avatar stations.\nSee my latest comment and the comment above it:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/1095-avatars-with-chairs-cause-players-to-be-stuck-on-spawnorigin-for-late-joine",
