  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-06-30T17:21:18.141Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In some worlds, opening a puppet menu will freeze everybody's avatars (position and IK) for everyone as long as that puppet menu stays open\nHow to reproduce:\n- One player should switch to any Avatars 3.0 avatar that has at least one puppet menu\n- Have 2 or more players join an instance of \"Camera Test\" world ( https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_91805f98-fd56-497a-bf7e-772e434efb84 ), or an instance of \"McDonald's\" world ( https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_6b77c061-a1bf-48eb-b107-c4d944490198 )\n- The 2 players should wave their hands and move around in the instance\n- That player opens the puppet menu\nObserved:\n- For each player's perspective, the other players in the instance are frozen in position (IK and avatar position) as long as the puppet menu is open\n- When the puppet menu is closed, the IK and player position becomes usual again\nExpected:\n- The puppet menu should not have any impact on the avatar position and IK\nThe currently known worlds that have this behavior are:\n- Camera Test: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_91805f98-fd56-497a-bf7e-772e434efb84\n- McDonald's: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_6b77c061-a1bf-48eb-b107-c4d944490198",
